My friends and I were accused of killing and stealing the treasury of Torm priests. We were driven out of town. But the mayor was too one-sided, when I mentioned the word Cyric, he immediately began to hesitate. Something is wrong here, maybe he was the one who authorized the attack on our caravan.~ // Same as XG0381.tra @7 // @18

@ = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

I managed to find the real killer of priest Torm. It was a follower of Cyric. The mayor withdrew all the charges against me and my friends and allowed me to build a Torm shrine.~ // Same as XGmyhs.tra @13 // @19
*/

@50432 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

The task is completed. Torm Temple built.~ // @20


// XGprtc2.tra

@50433 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

The battle continues. The high priest Torm called us again, this time to find the lost scroll. He gave us a map that will lead us to the treasure. A group of treasure seekers hired by the priests of Cyric also went for the scroll.~ // @9

@50434 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

Using the map, you managed to find an old scroll. Now you must return to the high priest.~ // @18 (Torm)

@50435 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

The storyline is over. (For the adherents of Torm)~ // @19


// XGskwr4.tra

@50436 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

I managed to get into the cave guarded by skeletons, where I need to find out what happened here.~ // @2


// XGTRBAN.tra

/*
@ = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

Thieves who entered the temple turned out to be two brothers. The one of the brothers who now has the book is trying to sell it to some priest somewhere outside the city walls.~ // Same as XG0047.tra @10 and XG0064.tra @6 // @11
*/

// XGVINEL.tra

@50437 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

In Trademeet, I met a wounded novice Torm, his name is Wintrell. He needs to find the evil that destroyed his caravan.
He marked on the map the place where this happened.~ // @12


@50438 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

I met the novice Torm Wintrell in Trademe, but I couldn't help him.~ // @9

/*
@ = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

In front of the cave, where the novice Torm sent me, there were 2 unusual skeletons. When I killed them, I found a gold ring in their skull. I think I should talk to Wintrell, maybe he knows something about this.~ // Same as XG0001.tra @1 // @24

@ = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

I managed to get into the cave guarded by skeletons, where I need to find out what happened here.~ // Same as XGskwr4.tra @2 // @25
*/

@50439 = ~L'Ordre et le Chaos

I tracked down the killer of the adherents of Torm, he turned out to be a priest of Cyric. Perhaps this is a confrontation between churches?~ // @26


//////////////////////  Hrothgar.
// Title

@50500 = ~Hrothgar~

/*
// XGH1 (same as XGH2 @7)

	//UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @4
@50501 = ~ Hrothgar.

I need to find a demon and free Hrothgar, the monster is hiding somewhere in a local cave. ~
*/

// XGH2

	//EraseJournalEntry(@7)
@50501 = ~Hrothgar

I need to find a demon and free Hrothgar, the monster is hiding somewhere in a local cave.~

	//EraseJournalEntry(@8)
@50502 = ~Hrothgar

The Paladin from Deep Water asked me for help. It is necessary to save the already dead hero from East Harbor. His name is Hrothgar and his followers have found a way to bring him back to life. But, unfortunately, the situation suddenly became complicated and a demon appeared instead of Hrothgar. If you kill the demon, Hrothgar will again be among the living.~

	//EraseJournalEntry(@9)
@50503 = ~Hrothgar

I talked to the wizard from the eastern harbor, I promised to help him revive Hrothgar, the demon is in a cave north of here.~

	//SOLVED_JOURNAL @10
@50504 = ~Hrothgar

The demon is dead, and Hrothgar, 100 years later, is again among the living. He invited me to look into his city in the Valley of the Ice Wind.~

/*
// XGHROT1

// (same as XGH2 @9)
	// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @10
@10 = ~ Hrothgar.

I talked to the wizard from the eastern harbor, I promised to help him revive Hrothgar, the demon is in a cave north of here. ~
*/

// XGPAL1

/*
// (same as XGH2 @8)
	// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @6
@50502 = ~ Hrothgar.

The Paladin from Deep Water asked me for help. It is necessary to save the already dead hero from East Harbor. His name is Hrothgar and his followers have found a way to bring him back to life. But, unfortunately, the situation suddenly became complicated and a demon appeared instead of Hrothgar. If you kill the demon, Hrothgar will again be among the living. ~
*/

	// SOLVED_JOURNAL @8
@50505 = ~Hrothgar

Job rejected.~


// XGHROTH

	// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @20
	// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @20
	// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @20
@50506 = ~Hrothgar

I met an adventurer in Targos, such as myself, his name is Hrotgar, he needed help, he was appointed to escort high-ranking people to Luskan. They were ambushed, they were attacked by a group of unknown creatures. Hrothgar told me that he saw them running north ... He found there a cave of complete evil. He asked me for help, together we must explore the caves and drive away evil!~ // Unused ?


//////////////////////  Siluvanede.
// Title

@50600 = ~Siluvanede~


// XG0180
/*
// (same as XGdrb2 @1)
	// AddJournalEntry(@9,QUEST)
@9 = ~Siluvanede

Priestess Shaar, the mother of the newly-ordained Elf Dhaerovatila, asked me to look after her son. He went south of the city. ~ // @9
*/

// XG0580

/*
// (same as XGdrb2 @3)
	// AddJournalEntry(@5,QUEST)
@5 = ~Siluvanede

When I entered the united house of Ched Nasad, my group was attacked, possibly the whole city! Something strange is going on here, one of the drow said that I was the one who foiled their plans. Priestess Eilistraee helped me out of the city, I have to come to their camp. I will find him if I walk along the trail in the east. ~ //
*/

// XGdrb1

  // UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @11
@50601 = ~Siluvanede

I promised the priestess of Eilistraee help in conducting peaceful negotiations with the priests of Chevaros. This world could end the threat from Ched Nasad.~ // @11

  // UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @13
@50602 = ~Siluvanede

Priestess Eilistraee found out that I accidentally killed her sisters. This can only be redeemed if I manage to kill the old dragon, which is located somewhere in the cave. If all goes well, the High Priestess will be ready to speak with me again.~ // @13

  //SOLVED_JOURNAL @15
@50603 = ~Siluvanede

You managed to turn everyone against yourself, both the drow from Ched Nasad and the drow priestesses of Eilistraee. The answers to your questions can no longer be found.~ // @15


//XGdrb2

	//EraseJournalEntry(@1)
@50604 = ~Siluvanede

Priestess Shaar, the mother of the newly-ordained Elf Dhaerovatila, asked me to look after her son. He went south of the city.~ // @1

	//EraseJournalEntry(@2)
@50605 = ~Siluvanede

I protected my son as promised. He wanted to join my company, but I refused. He gave me the task to find out why there were drow near the city and who killed them?~ // @2

	//EraseJournalEntry(@3)
@50606 = ~Siluvanede

When I entered the united house of Ched Nasad, my group was attacked, possibly the whole city! Something strange is going on here, one of the drow said that I was the one who foiled their plans. Priestess Eilistraee helped me out of the city, I have to come to their camp. I will find him if I walk along the trail in the east.~ // @3

	//EraseJournalEntry(@4)
@50607 = ~Siluvanede

Priestess Eilistraee found out that I accidentally killed her sisters. This can only be redeemed if I manage to kill the old dragon, which is located somewhere in the cave. If all goes well, the High Priestess will be ready to speak with me again.~ // @4

	//EraseJournalEntry(@5)
@50608 = ~Siluvanede

I promised the priestess of Eilistraee help in conducting peaceful negotiations with the priests of Chevaros. This world could end the threat from Ched Nasad.~ //@5

	//SOLVED_JOURNAL @6
@50609 = ~Siluvanede

The task is completed, the united houses of Ched Nasad are now crushed, as well as their leader.~ // @6


