@51303 = ~Marian le forgeron.

At Waukeen Promenade, I came across a frightened blacksmith, originally from Gludokovody. I heard a lot about this city of merchants. He said that there now cruel Barbarossa rules the local black market. I have to find him in a tavern or in a city market.~ // @9

same as @20 XGWWC.TRA
