Prisoner Marco seemed to know a lot about Deep Water. He gave me a pearl necklace and I have to show it to Marian.~ // @8


//  XGWTGC.d(UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @8)
  // ERASE ENTRY ADDED TO XGWWC.d ////////////////

@51302 = ~Marian le forgeron.

I spoke with Captain Boris about Barbarossa, and he told me that he escaped from him a few minutes ago ... He sent me to Deep Water Prison, I will talk with prisoner Marco, who is Boris's assistant in this assignment...~ // @8
*/

//  XGWWC.d(UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @16, EraseJournalEntry(@19), EraseJournalEntry(@20), EraseJournalEntry(@21), EraseJournalEntry(@16), EraseJournalEntry(@22), SetQuestDone(@23))

@51301 = ~Marian le forgeron

Prisoner Marco seemed to know a lot about Deep Water. He gave me a pearl necklace and I have to show it to Marian.~ // New erase

@51302 = ~Marian le forgeron

I spoke with Captain Boris about Barbarossa, and he told me that he escaped from him a few minutes ago ... He sent me to Deep Water Prison, I will talk with prisoner Marco, who is Boris's assistant in this assignment...~  // UNUSED

@51303 = ~Marian le forgeron

We could not kill Barbarosa, a guard appeared and took me to the captain. The captain clarified the situation to me. In the southeastern part of the city is the entrance to the Barbarosa guild.~ // @16 both Erase and quest // Quelque part au sud est de la ville, Mais personne n'a encore réussi à y pénétrer. Il parait qu'un membre de la bande de BARBA se trouverait en prison à Athkatla, il serait surmement judicieux de l'interroger. Et nous pourrons aussi demander à Marian....

@51304 = ~Marian le forgeron

À la Promenade de Waukyne, I came across a frightened blacksmith, originally from Gludokovody. I heard a lot about this city of merchants. He said that there now cruel Barbarossa rules the local black market. I have to find him in a tavern or in a city market.~ // @19

@51305 = ~Marian le forgeron

The blacksmith said everything you need. He asked you to find his family in a house located in the northeast of Deep Water. When you find, you must escort them to the headquarters of the city guard.~ // @20

@51306 = ~Marian le forgeron

We attacked Barbarossa, but he escaped before the battle began.~ // @21

@51307 = ~Marian le forgeron

I saved the blacksmith's wife from the killers sent by Barbarosa, now I know all three passwords that are needed to enter the guild in the southeast of the city.

Password: slave, market, black.~ // @22 // Voir pour l'horaire d'apparition des voleurs devant la guilde...

//SetQuestDone(@23) // (Enchaine sur la quête du seigneur masqué avec UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @24)

@51308 = ~Marian le forgeron

Barbarosa, the head of the black market in Deep Water, was stopped.~ // @23

	
//////////////////////    Shadow Lord. Seigneur masqué
// Title

@51400 = ~Seigneur masqué~ // Seigneur masqué

// XG0412 (SetQuestDone(@1), EraseJournalEntry(@2), EraseJournalEntry(@3), EraseJournalEntry(@4), EraseJournalEntry(@5))
@51401 = ~Seigneur masqué 

The lost fortress was re-discovered, its undead king was slain, and it is currently under the control of Deep Water. The Shadow Lord is pleased.~ // @1

@51402 = ~Seigneur masqué

The captain of the guard in Deep Water sends me to the shadow lord, apparently he has a special task for me. It's in the castle.~ // @2

@51403 = ~Seigneur masqué 

I was tasked with finding a strange wizard. Maybe I can find him in the city of priests, not far from Soubar.~ // @3

@51404 = ~Seigneur masqué

In a city of priests near Soubar, a high priest told me that he sent a strange wizard to a village nearby. He marked this place on my map.~ // @4

@51405 = ~Seigneur masqué

I got a new assignment. To find the hidden castle, we need the wizard I found, as well as the magic wand that was stolen from the magician near Deep Water.~ // @5

