// XGMILC (UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @10, EraseJournalEntry @10, EraseJournalEntry @17, EraseJournalEntry @18, EraseJournalEntry @19, EraseJournalEntry @20, SOLVED_JOURNAL @16, SOLVED_JOURNAL @24,)
@51501 = ~Assassin.

You entered the service of the city guard of the Gate of Baldur, your task is to track down the killer of 5 people. The last time a killer was seen in a tavern in the eastern part of the city.~ // @10


@51502 = ~Assassin.

I found the killer of those victims, his name is Artemis Entreri, I managed to injure him, but he escaped from the battle.~ // @16


@51503 = ~Assassin.

In the tavern, one of the visitors told me that someone had seen a local magician talking to a suspicious person, this may be the one I'm looking for.~ // @17


@51504 = ~Assassin.

I found the brother of one of the victims. He told me that before his death, his brother met with a man in the house of the Grand Duke.~ // @18


@51505 = ~Assassin.

I ran into killer Artemis in the city's sewer.~ // @19


@51506 = ~Assassin.

I didn't have the courage to fight the best killer of Féérune.~ // @20

@51507 = ~Assassin.

The guild of thieves hiding beneath the city is now over. But I missed Artemis.~ // @24

// UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @26 The nobleman is in danger. Seconde task de la milice suite à Artemis...

	
//////////////////////    Help the prisoner. Help the prisoner
// Title

@51600 = ~Un compagnon d'infortune ?~ // Help the prisoner

// XGERRA (UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @6, SOLVED_JOURNAL @11)
@51601 = ~Un compagnon d'infortune ?

J'ai rencontré un prisonnier blessé, soucieux de trouver une solution pour sortir de cet enfer, Il m'a dit que les gardes étaient à sa poursuite et que l'un d'entre eux possédait une clé permettant d'activer le portail vers la surface. 
Je dois impérativement mettre la main dessus... C'est peut-être notre chance de nous échapper.~ // @6


@51602 = ~Un compagnon d'infortune ?

J'ai trouvé la clé et l'ai remise à Errad... Évidemment il n'a pas tenu parole.  Me voila bien avancé.~ // @11

	
