// Title

@51700 = ~3 Relics~ // 3 Relics

// XGthf  (UNSOLVED_JOURNAL @6, SOLVED_JOURNAL @8)
@51701 = ~3 relics

One is in Atkatla, the second is somewhere in the Kalimport area, and the third is on the coast of Swords. If I find these relics, Toise Horster in Atkatl will pay me 10,000 gold for each of them. You can also leave them to yourself. Such powerful relics can be very useful.~ // @6

@51702 = ~3 relics

Task failed.~ // @8

