//////////////////////    The stolen. .
// Title XGWILL.D / XG0301.BAF  (XGSTGS.d)

@51900 = ~The stolen~ // The stolen


@51901 = ~The stolen

I met in the cave of a damned forest a warrior who claims that he escaped from a dungeon in the forest, and his friends were abducted by dark creatures. The time has come to find the source of darkness, it must be somewhere underground. ~


@51902 = ~The stolen

After the creatures died, I found Sir William's friends, they all went to him. ~

//////////////////////    Turlan forest. .
// Title XGLORU.D / XGELAD.D

@52000 = ~Turlan forest~ // Turlan forest


@52001 = ~Turlan forest

An elf named Eladriel told me about a mysterious forest near Neverwinter, he wants me to find a source of dark fog that envelops the forest.~

@52002 = ~Turlan forest

Eladriel was pleased and gave me his sword.~

@52003 = ~Turlan forest

In the dungeon of the forest, I found the Lord of the Undead, creating a magical fog around the forest, which gave strength to dark creatures and weakened normal people, they were all turned into werewolves, vampires and ghosts. I destroyed it and saved the forest, I have to go back to Eladriel for a reward.~

//////////////////////    Ice Castle. .
// Title XGELOR.D

@52100 = ~Ice Castle~ // Ice Castle

@52101 = ~Ice Castle

The mage Elorion of Baldur's Gate has lost his magical power, and a spell book has been stolen from him. He thinks that the thief is Rakshasa, a very dangerous creature located in the north of Faer Ôn in Ice Castle.~

@52102 = ~Ice Castle

On the island, I found Rakshasa and killed him. Yataka also received a spell book, which he subsequently gave to the magician Elorion.~

//////////////////////    Sorceress. .
// Title XGARUNL.D

@52200 = ~Sorceress~ // Sorceress

@52201 = ~Sorceress

Elf, the leader of the forest city, asked me to help. A certain witch settled in the mountains near the city and destroys the surrounding villages. I have to go there to find out more.~

@52202 = ~Sorceress

The witch is defeated.~

//////////////////////    Harp. .
// Title XGBARD.D

@52300 = ~Harp~ // Harp

@52301 = ~Harp

The wandering Bard lost a harp in the dungeon. If I find her, then I need to return to him.~

@52302 = ~Harp

I found the harp and returned it to the bard.~

//////////////////////    The nobleman is in danger. .
// Title XGMILC.D XGNOBG.D

@52400 = ~The nobleman is in danger~ // The nobleman is in danger

@52401 = ~The nobleman is in danger

I got the second task from the guard capit at Baldur's Gate. This time I have to deal with some forest creatures that attacked the friend of the captain, a nobleman in the village outside the city walls.~

@52402 = ~The nobleman is in danger

I saved a friend of the captain of the city guard at Baldur's Gate.~









